  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 0.81,
      "end_seconds": 3.45,
      "duration_seconds": 2.64,
      "text": "Good afternoon, how are you today?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 3.96,
      "end_seconds": 4.89,
      "duration_seconds": 0.93,
      "text": "Hi there."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 6.79,
      "end_seconds": 9.69,
      "duration_seconds": 2.9,
      "text": "was it a long journey this morning?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 11.6,
      "end_seconds": 15.25,
      "duration_seconds": 3.65,
      "text": "not too bad, the roads were quiet"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 15.91,
      "end_seconds": 18.65,
      "duration_seconds": 2.74,
      "text": "start wherever you like, I'm listening"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 19.61,
      "end_seconds": 23.65,
      "duration_seconds": 4.04,
      "text": "I wanted to get drenching night sweats looked at."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 25.53,
      "end_seconds": 28.78,
      "duration_seconds": 3.25,
      "text": "Has this been going on for long?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 29.69,
      "end_seconds": 35.57,
      "duration_seconds": 5.88,
      "text": "I'd say about a week. Actually, no, closer to two weeks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 37.67,
      "end_seconds": 47.53,
      "duration_seconds": 9.86,
      "text": "tell me a bit more about it: how bad it gets, how often, and whether anything makes it better or worse"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 48.28,
      "end_seconds": 60.82,
      "duration_seconds": 12.54,
      "text": "Erm, it feels mild to me. Only changing my clothes, and it's not much. And there's a lump in my armpit as well, one week now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 62.87,
      "end_seconds": 65.12,
      "duration_seconds": 2.25,
      "text": "I'll do your observations first."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 76.6,
      "end_seconds": 79.18,
      "duration_seconds": 2.58,
      "text": "That's it, just a little longer..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 96.62,
      "end_seconds": 105.3,
      "duration_seconds": 8.68,
      "text": "Okay: respiratory rate 20, pressure 122 over 72, pulse is 104 beats a minute. And SpO2 97 percent on room air."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 106.22,
      "end_seconds": 108.28,
      "duration_seconds": 2.06,
      "text": "Is that alright, doctor?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 109.38,
      "end_seconds": 112.71,
      "duration_seconds": 3.33,
      "text": "I'll explain what these mean in a moment."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 114.52,
      "end_seconds": 119.03,
      "duration_seconds": 4.51,
      "text": "alright, over here please and I'll take a look"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 120.12,
      "end_seconds": 121.6,
      "duration_seconds": 1.48,
      "text": "Fine by me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 123.37,
      "end_seconds": 126.51,
      "duration_seconds": 3.14,
      "text": "Alright, I'll listen to your chest now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 140.53,
      "end_seconds": 142.72,
      "duration_seconds": 2.19,
      "text": "I can't feel your spleen"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 146.87,
      "end_seconds": 148.68,
      "duration_seconds": 1.81,
      "text": "You can relax now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 163.68,
      "end_seconds": 164.87,
      "duration_seconds": 1.19,
      "text": "how about cough?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 165.88,
      "end_seconds": 168.86,
      "duration_seconds": 2.98,
      "text": "No, I haven't had any cough."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 170.38,
      "end_seconds": 177.31,
      "duration_seconds": 6.93,
      "text": "Let me check a few things. Any recent travel, joint pain or chest pain?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 178.36,
      "end_seconds": 181.18,
      "duration_seconds": 2.82,
      "text": "No, none that I've noticed."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 182.56,
      "end_seconds": 184.75,
      "duration_seconds": 2.19,
      "text": "Is your chest okay generally?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 186.75,
      "end_seconds": 188.27,
      "duration_seconds": 1.52,
      "text": "no, nothing there"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 189.51,
      "end_seconds": 192.09,
      "duration_seconds": 2.58,
      "text": "Anything different when you pass water?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 193.56,
      "end_seconds": 195.0,
      "duration_seconds": 1.44,
      "text": "No changes there."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 202.62,
      "end_seconds": 206.15,
      "duration_seconds": 3.53,
      "text": "What do you take on a normal day?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 207.37,
      "end_seconds": 213.2,
      "duration_seconds": 5.83,
      "text": "Let me think, I'm on Dolo, when I get the fever."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 214.25,
      "end_seconds": 216.86,
      "duration_seconds": 2.61,
      "text": "and and what strength is that?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 217.39,
      "end_seconds": 218.31,
      "duration_seconds": 0.92,
      "text": "650 milligrams"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 218.89,
      "end_seconds": 222.74,
      "duration_seconds": 3.85,
      "text": "Hm, okay. Now some background about your lifestyle."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 224.67,
      "end_seconds": 234.17,
      "duration_seconds": 9.5,
      "text": "I swim twice a week. I'm a hairdresser, on my feet all day. My partner and our baby."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 235.12,
      "end_seconds": 238.5,
      "duration_seconds": 3.38,
      "text": "Let me ask about allergies, anything at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 239.48,
      "end_seconds": 241.6,
      "duration_seconds": 2.12,
      "text": "No allergies at all."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 251.1,
      "end_seconds": 255.02,
      "duration_seconds": 3.92,
      "text": "Do you have any medical conditions I should know about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 256.51,
      "end_seconds": 258.28,
      "duration_seconds": 1.77,
      "text": "no, no conditions"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 268.0,
      "end_seconds": 278.84,
      "duration_seconds": 10.84,
      "text": "So So where does that leave us? I think we're dealing with an enlarged gland with night sweats that needs a proper work-up at this stage."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 279.56,
      "end_seconds": 282.58,
      "duration_seconds": 3.02,
      "text": "what are the odds it's serious?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 283.12,
      "end_seconds": 305.66,
      "duration_seconds": 22.54,
      "text": "I understand the worry. At the moment I'd say it's an enlarged gland with night sweats that needs a proper work-up, and we'll know more once the a chest X-ray is back. I'd like to arrange a chest X-ray for night sweats. I'd like to arrange an ultrasound of the armpit for lymph node."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 307.35,
      "end_seconds": 311.0,
      "duration_seconds": 3.65,
      "text": "ah, you know, is that done today?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 311.73,
      "end_seconds": 330.37,
      "duration_seconds": 18.64,
      "text": "keep a note of your temperature each evening. The The thing that would worry me is if the symptoms get worse. If that happens, go to emergency. Book a review in a week. That's all from me. Any questions?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 331.39,
      "end_seconds": 336.03,
      "duration_seconds": 4.64,
      "text": "Hmm, okay, that makes sense. Thanks for explaining."
    }
  ]
}